  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "つよい　かんじょうを　もつ　ものは\nそれが　だれであれ　だまらせる。\nそのしゅだんは　じつに　らんぼう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강한 감정을 품은 자라면\n누가 됐든 조용하게 만드는데\n그 수단이 매우 난폭하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "遇到情緒激昂的對手時，\n無論對方是誰，都會用\n粗暴的方式使其沉默。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "S’il ressent des émotions trop fortes, il en fera\ntaire la source, quelle qu’elle soit, en utilisant\ndes méthodes assez violentes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Empfindet jemand starke Emotionen, bringt es\nihn auf gewaltsame Art zum Schweigen, egal,\num wen es sich dabei handelt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Silencia a cualquiera que muestre una emoción\nintensa sin importar de quién se trate y recurre\npara ello a métodos a cuál más violento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se qualcuno esterna emozioni troppo forti,\nlo affronta immediatamente e lo mette a\ntacere senza tanti convenevoli.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No matter who you are, if you bring strong\nemotions near this Pokémon, it will silence\nyou violently.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "強い　感情を　もつ　ものは\nそれが　誰であれ　黙らせる。\nその手段は　じつに　乱暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "遇到情绪激昂的对手时，\n无论对方是谁，都会用\n粗暴的方式使其沉默。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Silencia a cualquiera que muestre una emoción\nintensa sin importar de quién se trate y recurre\npara ello a métodos a cuál más violento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまのフサで　あいてを　なぐり\nだまらせる。　プロボクサーさえ\nいっぱつ　ＫＯの　はかいりょく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 술로 상대를 때려\n꼼짝 못 하게 한다. 프로복서조차\n한 방에 KO되는 파괴력이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用頭上的辮子攻擊對手，\n讓對方安靜下來。破壞力\n強到能一擊ＫＯ職業拳擊手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il frappe ses ennemis avec ses tresses pour les\nfaire taire. Sa puissance est telle qu’il peut mettre\nK.O. un boxeur professionnel d’un seul coup.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein Schlag mit den Quasten an seinem Kopf\nbringt Gegner zum Schweigen. Ein Treffer genügt,\num einen Profiboxer auf die Bretter zu schicken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Silencia al objetivo atizándole con los mechones.\nDespliega una potencia devastadora capaz de\nnoquear a un boxeador profesional.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zittisce gli avversari colpendoli con le nappe che\nha ai lati della testa. È così forte da mandare KO\ncon un colpo anche un pugile professionista.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Using the braids on its head, it pummels foes to\nget them to quiet down. One blow from those\nbraids would knock out a professional boxer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の房で　相手を　殴り\n黙らせる。　プロボクサーさえ\n一発　ＫＯの　破壊力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用头上的辫子攻击对手，\n让对方安静下来。破坏力\n强到能一击ＫＯ职业拳击手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Silencia al objetivo atizándole con los mechones.\nDespliega una potencia devastadora capaz de\nnoquear a un boxeador profesional.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たとえ　しあわせな　きもちであってもたかぶった　かんじょうは　すさまじいそうおんとして　かんじるらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "아무리 행복한 감정일지라도 고조된 감정이라면 무엇이든 엄청난 소음으로 느낀다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "高亢的情緒在牠看來似乎都是強烈的噪音，即使是幸福的心情也不例外。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On dit que lorsqu’il perçoit des émotions intenses, c’est comme s’il entendait un bruit effroyable, même quand il s’agit de sentiments de joie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Starke Emotionen anderer Lebewesen sind für dieses Pokémon offenbar wie ohrenbetäubender Lärm. Das gilt auch für Glücksgefühle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
